{{Quote|Allows the user to unleash hellish flames and transform into an infernal revenant wielding a blazing chainsaw.|Shop}}
'''Hellfire''' is a {{Mythical}} [[mutation]] of [[Gas]].

Hellfire allows the user to create, become, and manipulate concentrated and flammable infernal flames, unleashing devastating slicing against unfortunate foes. Additionally, the user can even transform into a Skeletal-Depicted spirit.

The Hellfire mutation has much lower combo potential and moveset synergy when compared to [[Gas]], exchanging it for much superior damage, range and mobility.

==Obtainment==
As a [[mutation]], Hellfire has different obtainment methods compared to ordinary [[Blox Fruits]]. 

Players are able to obtain it by:
* Rolling it through the limited-time [[Spooky Gacha]].
* Buying it with {{Robux|1250}} from the mutation section of the [[Gas]] fruit. (Must own [[Permanent Blox Fruits|Permanent]] Gas first).
* Buying it with {{Robux|3499}} from the [[Shop#Bundles|Soulfire Bundle]] during the [[Events#Halloween Event 2026|Halloween Event 2026]] 
** Players with Roblox Plus activated for over 2 months have the bundle's cost reduced to {{Robux|2799}}.
* By defeating the [[Hellfire Gas (Raid Boss)]] during the [[Events#Halloween Event 2026|Halloween Event 2026]], with an extremely rare chance of dropping the physical '''Hellfire '''fruit.

