== Trivia ==
* '''Hellfire''' is the first [[Elemental]] [[Mutations|Mutation]].
* Along with [[Magma]] and [[Tiger]], the '''Hellfire''' transformation is able to walk on [[Lava]].
* This is the second [[Mutations|mutation]] to be part of the Halloween Event.
* '''Hellfire''' can spawn under trees like [[Werewolf]] during 2025 Halloween event.

